  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5401.13 Rider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5401.13 “Rider” means “transportation network company rider” as defined in RSA 376-A:1, VII, namely, “a person who uses a transportation network company's digital network to connect with a transportation network driver who provides prearranged rides to the rider in the driver's personal vehicle between points chosen by the rider.”\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5400.html"
}
